# Keeps the assets/ directory in version control.
#
# The bot looks for START_PIC and FSUB_PIC here (assets/start.jpg and
# assets/fsub.jpg by default). Those image files are git-ignored so nobody
# commits large binaries, which means the directory would otherwise vanish from
# a fresh clone and the README's "put your images in assets/" step would refer
# to a path that does not exist.
#
# Missing images are not fatal: plugins.context.answer_with_photo checks that
# the file exists and falls back to a plain text reply.
